00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:00.930
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:04.060
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.600
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:12.560
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:19.930
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:23.310
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.810
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:30.310
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.930
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:35.430
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.220
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:42.430
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.850
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:51.020
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:52.100
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:55.680
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.060
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.770
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:04.020
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:12.270
<b>Unspecialized Strikes</b>

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.120
You asked us to come here,

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:18.540
Are you want to join our team?

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:20.040
No.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:21.540
I'd like to make a deal with you.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:27.620
If I'm correct, you're aiming at entering
the Pro-League in next season.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:29.870
We've been approved.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:30.870
The rest is just a matter of time.

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:32.250
I'm sure we'll get there.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.000
Well, then it's time to start promoting.

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:36.870
Get the attentions.

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:38.790
It's kind of tricky, right?

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.000
How about I do you favor?

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.750
You wanna have Ye Qiu?

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.750
Or should I say, have Ye Qiu in Heavenly Justice?

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:53.870
You're joining Heavenly Justice?

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:55.040
What are you thinking?

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.910
Joining the guild doesn't mean I'll also join their team.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:01.620
If they need a gimmick, we'll give them a gimmick.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.790
What's in it for us?

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.160
Didn't you notice it's been a bit quieter lately?

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:07.790
Oh, yeah.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.620
We don't have that many people people after us.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:11.500
That's because I'm famous now.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.120
They can't really do anything in the public.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:18.750
So you made a big scene with the challenges on purpose?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:25.470
Well, if I couldn't make it, that'll be on purpose.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.250
However, peace is only temporary.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.540
This is the right time for we to find an ally.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.180
Are you really Ye Qiu?

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.540
Yeah, the one you're thinking right now.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:39.370
But Master Ye Qiu never does promotion.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.750
I didn't say I would do.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.000
It's more than enough to have your name with us.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:49.750
I'll really think about it.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:51.370
Keep me posted.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.290
He's too much trouble.

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:57.250
He's taking it seriously.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.540
The more discreet he is, the better for us.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:05.910
But what if they just use you and then kick you out?

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:08.120
They're on the same boat with us.

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:09.750
There's no need to kick us out.

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:13.500
Besides, even if they want me, I still have to leave.

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.370
We'll build our own team.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:20.500
Hello!

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:21.500
You must be Lord Grim!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:24.870
I've seen your Arena video,
would you mind to do a PVP with me?

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:25.870
Lord Grim?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:26.620
Where, where?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.120
That's a Master.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.000
Yeah!

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:34.850
(Happy Net Cafe)

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:35.500
A room please.

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:36.770
Sure.

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:38.120
It's registered.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.040
You can go to the second floor, thank you.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:40.590
OK.

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:50.750
My seat...

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:53.870
Your seat's not here.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:55.120
Come with me.

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.620
We've moved you upstairs to the room.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.250
What's with the sudden change?

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.000
So that you're not gonna be disturbed.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:05.040
We're building a pro-team now.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.270
We can't have our customers watching us.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:10.870
Way to go.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.000
Very visionary.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.370
When the team gets big,

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:23.620
we can make a special section on
the second floor as the training room.

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:27.750
It might look shabby right now...

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:29.260
It's okay.

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:32.030
Every team's like that in the beginning.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.410
No way.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.250
I mean, back in the day.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.250
Well, who's taking the night shifts these days?

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:48.750
Don't worry about it.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.910
You just focus on starting the team.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.040
What?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.540
Are you not happy about that?

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:57.870
No.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.000
I'm just saying, you hit the jackpot.

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.250
What?

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.660
The pay you offer is good enough for a night shift manager.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.120
But now we're talking about getting a team.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.870
Then I'm worth much more than that.

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.120
Woah, talk about being grateful.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:14.750
I'm only telling the truth.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:21.120
Well, how about

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.410
I give you a raise?

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:22.870
No need to.

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:24.250
You let me eat and live here.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.040
It's good enough.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.370
Got message from Loulan Slash.

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:28.370
Come on.

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:28.870
Get online.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.000
This doesn't feel right.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.500
Why did we start this conversation?

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.950
(Main City for Heavenly Justice Guild)

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:50.370
After giving a careful thought to this,

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:54.870
we've decided to take your offer.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.890
Loulan Slash invited you to join Heavenly Justice

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:58.930
Lord Grim, welcome to Heavenly Justice!
You are now a member

00:06:59.040 --> 00:06:59.910
I'm sure we will be great.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.620
He is such a drama king.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.120
I'm sure we'll have a great time working together.

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:15.120
Later, if you two have the time,
you can go check it up online.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.250
Glory forum, eSports sites and so on.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.790
You've started the marketing?

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.620
Now if it's OK for you,

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:30.500
I wonder if you can fight our key players, you know, just for fun.

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:33.000
You want to see if I'm the real Ye Qiu.

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:34.540
Kind of.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:37.370
But it's more of a measure to our own levels.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.370
Master Ye Qiu, if you please.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:07.910
Cool!

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:12.200
As always.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:14.700
I'm not even close.

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:16.330
I can't be in the pro game.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:17.330
What's going on?

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.040
With this mindset, you can't really
enter the professional world.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:24.660
Let's call it off for today.

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:25.410
What?

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:26.910
Can't handle the gap?

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.160
Yeah, kind of.

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:31.830
We are real-life friends.

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.910
We want to improve ourselves with skills.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:35.910
That's why we started this team.

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:38.910
We were thinking about going into Pro-League.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.410
At least make it to the playoffs.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.540
And get lucky in the playoffs,

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.160
accidentally win a world championship or something, right?

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:48.290
Well...

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:51.830
Compared to the Pro-League, you're only starting off.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:53.290
Be down-to-earth.

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:54.450
One step at a time.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:00.330
And don't take it too serious with today's game.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.790
It's not that you're not good enough, it's that I'm just too good.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.540
Ye Qiu joined the Heavenly Justice?

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:12.450
Yes.

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:15.540
It's all over the internet right now.

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:21.160
Heavenly Sword, a new team coached by Ye Qiu.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.330
You gotta be kidding me.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.540
Was that person with him from Heavenly Justice?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:29.540
Should we send someone out there?

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:31.080
You mean to attack them?

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.040
You idiot!

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.540
Now the world knows that Lord Grim is Ye Qiu.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.540
You want the fans to find out that we're targeting him?

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:41.540
Get everyone ready.

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:42.790
Conference room, now!

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:43.790
Yes sir.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.170
<b>(Lord Grim's not teaming up with those money players!)</b>

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.850
<b>(Rich kids are going pro now, good to have money)</b>

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.160
<b>(Ye Qiu gonna be in Heavenly Justice)</b>

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.270
These guys might not be that good at team building,

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.270
but definitely great at marketing.

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:57.540
Yes?

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.160
They hold on to the news on purpose online.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.040
First announce me joining Heavenly Justice.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.700
Then put it on the news that
they're putting together as a team.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.290
From the very beginning to the end,
they never said I'd join their team.

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:10.660
No.

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.650
So that they're not gonna get backfired afterwards.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.410
But that's kind of misleading.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:17.450
Of course.

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:20.910
Oh, manipulations.

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:24.410
You have to know how to manipulate to stay in this business.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:26.410
Well done.

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:27.700
Among all the rookie teams,

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.290
this is the best opening I've seen.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:30.950
It's all right, I guess.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.790
Next, I suggest you take it one step at a time,

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:35.200
spread your news out, bit by bit.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:37.920
Oh?

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:40.160
With a publicity like this,

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.200
the other teams will be onto you.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.040
Heavenly Justice will be a clear target for all.

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.450
But now you're getting a lot of attention,

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.200
so they don't have the guts to make the move in public.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:51.160
You got me?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:52.540
Understood.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.410
Take your time with the news.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.040
Keep the attention on you as long as you can.

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:07.920
(Glory Pro-players chat group)

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:12.540
News, news!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.220
Why did Master Ye Qiu suddenly join Heavenly Justice?

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:14.950
<b>Ghost Lantern (Li Xun)</b>

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:16.330
What the hell is he doing?

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:16.350
Go ask him then.

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:17.600
<b>Flying Drops (Li Yihui)</b>

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:17.790
Go ask him then.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:18.680
Is he still in this group?

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:20.640
<b>Doubtful Demon (Fang Rui)</b>

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:20.770
He is. That's him.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:22.520
<b>Lord Grim
Crying Devil (Li Xuan)</b>

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:26.830
He's definitely here at this hour.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:27.830
I bet he's pretending to be AFK.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.250
Ye Qiu come out!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.160
Don't pretend you're not here.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.000
I know you're!

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:32.500
Who has befriended him?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.290
Let us know.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.040
Don't be quiet.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:35.500
Su must have.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:36.500
Where is she?

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:37.660
She's not on either.

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:38.540
Her ID is gray.

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:39.750
Is she going invisible?

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:41.790
Why do you all love being invisible?

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.250
Who got access to Su?

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:44.410
Yunxiu must have.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:46.410
Who poked me?

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:47.620
Is Su Mucheng on?

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:48.540
No.

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:50.870
Don't lie to me just because you're buddies.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.040
I'm not looking for her.

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.000
I'm Just checking in on Ye Qiu.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:55.290
Then go @Ye Qiu.

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:58.620
Ye Qiu, Ye Qiu, Ye Qiu, Ye Qiu, Ye Qiu!

00:11:59.000 --> 00:11:59.500
You see?

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:00.120
He's not showing up.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:01.370
Wrong keyword.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:05.370
One Autumn Leaf, One Autumn Leaf, One Autumn Leaf.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:07.000
One Autumn Leaf?

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.120
Who @ me?

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.500
Not you, I'm looking for Ye Qiu.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:15.080
<b>One Autumn Leaf (Sun Xiang)</b>

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:15.830
Ye Qiu?

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:16.330
<b>One Autumn Leaf (Sun Xiang)</b>

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:17.750
He's retired, he won't be here.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.500
Stay low-key! Or you'll be kicked out.

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:21.350
Try Lord Grim.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:22.930
<b>Misty Rain (Chu Yunxiu)</b>

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:23.150
<b>Lord Grim</b>

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:24.250
Who wants me?

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:26.620
I knew you are here.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.500
Shame on you!

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:30.410
Hey, guys. Long time no see.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:33.920
(Master's here!)

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:34.950
Okay.

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:36.700
Done with greetings, I'm out.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:40.830
You just said one sentence!

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:42.330
I'm not like you.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:45.900
(Hahaha)

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.750
Zhou Zekai, none of your business.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:52.700
That who, don't leave yet.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:53.750
What are you up to lately?

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:56.000
Leveling.

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:57.270
<b>Troubling Rain (Huang Shaotian)</b>

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:58.350
That's not what I asked.

00:12:58.350 --> 00:12:59.700
<b>Troubling Rain (Huang Shaotian)</b>

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.620
What the hell are you doing with Heavenly Justice?

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:02.000
<b>Troubling Rain (Huang Shaotian)</b>

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.200
Joining a guild in an online game.

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:04.580
Easy as that.

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:06.580
Don't play dumb.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:07.700
For real.

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:10.370
Is any of your guilds want to take me, I'll be right in.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:12.450
But no one came for me.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.080
Why don't you come to us Blue Brook?

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:16.870
Are you in charge?

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:19.810
He's not.
<b>Swoksaar (Yu Wenzhou)</b>

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:20.080
He's not.

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.950
Captain, don't pull my leg!

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.330
Let's go solo in Arena.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.250
I've been asking for centuries!

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:29.830
Let me see your Unspecialized.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.580
I'm only level 52.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.250
Are you kidding me?

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.000
That's easy.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:35.950
We can do it in Fix Field.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:37.700
You got the balls or not?

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:38.500
Sure.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:39.700
Fix Field 4.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.500
Room 2164.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.080
Password same as room number.

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:48.700
Troubling Rain?

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:51.350
Oh my god!

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:52.600
Cloud Piercer!

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:55.950
It's Desert Dust!

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.000
I saw Vaccaria!

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.330
All pro-accounts!

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:00.200
What's going on here?

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:00.620
Oh my god.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:01.950
Is it the end of the world

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.660
I want a picture!

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.270
The King's Avatar 2

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.120
Why is Master not here yet?

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.580
He said he would come do PVP with us.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.580
What's taking so long?

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:19.850
Current member
Room

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:21.580
I did set password for this.

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:22.700
How did these people...?

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:26.950
Troubling Rain?

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:31.200
Who are you?

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:33.500
Ye Qiu, where are you?

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:34.200
What the heck?

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.120
Or are you Ye Qiu?

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.200
Let's get this started.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:39.580
What are you doing here?

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:42.080
What are you still up?

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.200
I still have four minutes.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:44.830
Ye Qiu, you're a liar!

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:45.950
I want to go solo with you!

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:47.500
Why did you call someone else here?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:48.450
Go, Huang!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:49.500
Let's see what he got.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.450
Who is this guy?

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:51.450
I don't even know him.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:52.500
Is he as good as you?

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.580
You didn't know Loulan Slash?

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:55.580
He's getting together that the team.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:57.950
So you're Loulan Slash.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.330
Why don't you say anything?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:14:59.870
AFK?

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:00.750
How can we start if you go AFK?

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:01.250
Automatic fight?

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.000
Are you in or what?

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:04.700
DESERT DUST
User: Han Wenqing
IMMOVABLE ROCK
User: Zhang Xinjie

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:05.450
What's going on?

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:06.080
User: Yu Wenzhou
SWOKSAAR

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:07.570
Why are here so many pro-players?

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:09.020
User: Wang Jiexi
VACCARIA

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:10.890
CLOUD PIERCER, User: Zhou Zekai

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:12.810
DOUBTFUL DEMON
User: Fang Rui

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.580
Master, what is this?

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:19.700
It's a rare opportunity.

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:20.720
Got Sword Saint as your coach.

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:21.370
Come on.

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:21.870
Are you here?

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:22.450
Auto attack?

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:23.830
Are you gonna fight or not?

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:26.850
User: Huang Shaotian
TROUBLING RAIN

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:27.050
Troubling Rain invite you to fight

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:27.580
I'm in.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:27.970
Troubling Rain invite you to fight

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.800
(Berserker, Loulan Slash VS Blade Master, Troubling Rain)

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.580
What's taking you so long?

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:32.330
Come on, let's go!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:33.580
I'll finish you fast. Then to fight Ye Qiu.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:35.580
Shadow Steps with 6 shadows.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:36.830
I hear you're putting together a team.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:37.830
Terrific.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.830
Is this the account that you're gonna use?

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:40.830
Woah.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.120
Heavy Sword.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:43.750
The swordsman's master orange weapon.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.250
Good thing we're at Fix Field.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.200
Or I'll be damned.

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:50.120
You got it!

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:52.200
Well, I guess there's a reason you want a team.

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.450
But I haven't gone full on yet.

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:54.700
Look out, bro.

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:00.500
On you head!

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.450
Shaotian, take it slow.

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:09.750
Don't do this to the new guy.

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:11.080
How is this Berserker?

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.200
He didn't do anything at all.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.080
He got pinned down by Huang right from the beginning.

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:15.950
(Loulan Slash)

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.370
He has a certain level of awareness.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:17.390
(Loulan Slash)

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:19.370
But he's off the beat.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.330
It's common for a rookie.

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:25.700
And this scene, probably shocked him.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:26.580
How's it?

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:27.950
It's been two minutes.

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.330
You could say he's worse than any of new pro-player.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:33.750
Lao Lou.

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:35.870
His rival might also be the reason.

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:37.950
Besides, the mic is on.

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:39.620
Upward Slash.

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:40.120
Sword Draw.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:40.700
Headwind Strike.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.330
Lunge.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:41.870
Blade Storm.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:42.450
Sword Draw.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:43.330
Formless Phantom Blade.

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:43.950
Upward Slash.

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:44.520
Sword Draw.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:45.100
Damn it!

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:48.200
His moves are different from what he said would be!

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:55.580
Any thoughts, bro?

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.500
You're too loud.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:04.370
Did Ye Qiu just leave you here
for me to shatter your confidence?

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:06.330
Are you guys on the same side or not?

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.580
You're no match for me.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:08.580
I'll kill you right now.

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:09.700
And then I can fight Ye Qiu.

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:10.450
That's a deal, OK.

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:35.700
Enrage!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.200
Going all in, impressive.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.330
20 second buff on strength and speed.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.830
Make sure you take advantage.

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:46.830
Go Berserk is a good way to handle it.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:51.080
But it's going to be easy to use it against
pro-players, especially Huang Shaotian.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:55.750
Not bad.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.500
Not bad when you're on Enrage.

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:06.080
So, isn't it a pity that it can only last 20 seconds?

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.370
I have to make it to the next Enrage.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.080
Then I can be on him again.

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:13.330
Until then, I have to avoid confrontation.

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:14.120
I have to hold on to it.

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:15.200
I have to

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:17.120
survive to the next Enrage!

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:23.450
I have to!

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.200
Just hang in there!

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:29.120
If I can do this once, I can do it again.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.080
If I can make it happen again,

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.330
then maybe I can win.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:34.950
Right now!

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:41.200
Enrage does give you remarkable buffs.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:44.200
But it also comes with debuffs in defense.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:48.080
I've been waiting for this moment to surprise you.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:56.620
You played well.

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:58.580
But I'm better.

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:01.450
It's no big deal.

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:02.700
Where's Ye Qiu?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.450
Why don't you get down here?

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.330
You just got out of one fight.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:06.120
Don't wanna take some rest?

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.080
Zhang Xinjie went to bed already.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.620
I don't care if he goes to bed or not.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:12.120
Don't you make excuses and run.

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:14.700
Dude, get lost.

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:16.700
You don't want to miss a second of this next fight.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.700
It's going to be very helpful to you.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.250
Don't be slow.

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:25.700
Come on down.

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:35.580
Don't call me a bully.

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:36.950
Cut the crap.

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:37.620
Take that!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:45.200
Ouch.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.160
Deformation.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:48.290
That was fast.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:52.250
If you don't know about this weapon, it's going to be a disaster.

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:53.870
Hello, is this thing broken?

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:55.870
Who's gonna fight your Battle Mage?

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.250
I've seen it all.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.250
Where are your other classes? Other skills?

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:00.750
Show me what you got, Unspecialized.

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:04.250
Hello?

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.160
Say something.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.620
He must have taken his headphones off!

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:09.360
Forget it.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.250
I'm gonna make you do it.

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:32.320
(Troubling Rain)

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.500
Ranged DPS, that's convenient.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:39.750
What about close combat?

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:40.620
I'll give it a try.

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:47.750
Using sword in front of me?

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:48.870
I'm going to show you how to use it.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:53.540
Nice dodge.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.870
But it's not over yet.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:57.000
Watch this!

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:05.500
Shame on you!

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:08.870
You got all the cheap tricks from every class!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.000
This weapon is difficult to guard.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.910
It would be easier if it couldn't transform that much.

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:14.620
But it's got so many forms.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.000
It's got every class covered.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:17.870
You mean only the six main classes?

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.500
Or does all sub-classes also involved?

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:20.870
There's got to be more than six.

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:22.600
Can't you see he's already got the shields?

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:25.120
That's gonna be complicated.

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.000
You scumbag.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.410
You used Vanishing Steps?

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:31.410
What kind of sick combo is this?

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:32.870
Do you have to go that hard on me?

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:35.370
This is like an explosion.

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:37.620
Huang might not even be able to strike back.

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:41.620
There's just so much room as an Unspecialized.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:43.000
It's easy for you to say.

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:46.870
All 120 different skills, put them together as a consecutive combo.

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:47.750
Who can do that?

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:49.080
Come on, Huang.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:50.160
Shut up!

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.000
Why don't you come down here and try?

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.370
Got time to talk back?

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:55.290
Are you enjoying the massage in the air?

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:56.000
Captain Yu.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.750
It'd be a shame to lose like this.

00:21:58.750 --> 00:21:59.500
There should be punishment.

00:21:59.620 --> 00:22:01.000
What do you think, Captain Yu?

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:03.540
Shaotian is about to lose.

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:04.410
Why?

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:06.370
Unspecialized can be complicated.

00:22:06.750 --> 00:22:07.870
It takes experience to fight with this class.

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:11.160
But now no one has that kind of experience.

00:22:11.790 --> 00:22:13.870
So Shaotian is having a little trouble keeping up.

00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:17.250
Ye Qiu knows how to use that.

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:20.040
All his combos are not the common pack.

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:25.750
He's not even using skills from the same class in a row.

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:28.120
I'm impressed.

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:29.160
What should I do?

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:30.250
I'm about to die!

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:30.870
Huang.

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:31.790
Your captain's pointing you in the right direction.

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:32.750
Did you hear him?

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:33.620
Shut up.

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:34.120
Captain Yu.

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:35.620
He told you to shut it.

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:40.750
No response at all.

00:22:40.910 --> 00:22:41.790
Is his headset really off?

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:43.370
Shameless asshole.

00:22:43.770 --> 00:22:44.770
Don't let me catch you.

00:22:45.040 --> 00:22:46.250
Or you will be dead.

00:22:50.120 --> 00:22:50.790
Collapsing Fist!

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:55.790
Next move, should be Shadow Cloak.

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:06.870
Falling Phoenix Slash!

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:33.220
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:38.350
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:43.180
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:23:43.180 --> 00:23:45.350
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:23:47.770 --> 00:23:49.970
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:23:50.310 --> 00:23:51.930
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:23:52.180 --> 00:23:54.060
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:23:54.060 --> 00:23:56.220
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:00.930
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:04.220
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:24:04.220 --> 00:24:07.470
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:09.600
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:11.310
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:24:11.310 --> 00:24:13.100
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:16.350
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:24:18.470 --> 00:24:20.350
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:22.520
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪
